#: ../../src/gsoc.md:5 d71701e5dc094c458f28e02564db232d
msgid ""
"The [Google Summer of Code](https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com) is a "
"global, online program focused on bringing new contributors into open source"
" software development.  Contributors work with an open source organization "
"on a 12+ week-long program under the guidance of mentors."
msgstr ""
"[Google Summer of Code](https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com) "
"是一项全球性的在线计划，旨在吸引新的贡献者参与开源软件开发。贡献者将在导师指导下，与某个开源组织一起完成为期 12 周以上的项目。"

